      "text": "PHRASES=(\n    \"OpenShift AI is great!\"\n    \"This model is terrible and slow.\"\n    \"I love working with Kubernetes.\"\n    \"The deployment failed again.\"\n    \"Red Hat training is excellent.\"\n    \"Everything is broken today.\"\n    \"Monitoring metrics is very useful.\"\n    \"I hate debugging network issues.\"\n    \"Grafana dashboards look amazing.\"\n    \"The cluster is completely down.\"\n)",
